  "OpenRouterImageNode/microsoft/mai-image-2.6": {"source":"bfl-kling-minimax-others.json","label":"MAI Image 2.6","vendor":"Microsoft","strengths":"Microsoft's own image model, 1K or 1.5K with seven ratios","notes":"New in the 2026-09-11 catalog, reached through OpenRouter rather than from Microsoft directly, which is why the model id carries a vendor prefix. Everything lives inside the `model` dynamic combo. Up to 5 reference images. The generated label reads \"Microsoft/mai Image 2.6\", so this record sets one.","capabilities":{"resolutions":["1K","1.5K"],"aspects":["1:1","16:9","9:16","3:2","2:3","4:3","3:4","auto"],"audio":false,"negativePrompt":false,"batch":{"min":1,"max":1}},"price":{"unit":"per-image","credits":11.82,"confidence":"published","note":"Billed on tokens, not per image: the node's price_badge charges the prompt at 5 and the output at 38 US dollars per million tokens, times 1.43, and the output token count is fixed per resolution and ratio. The figures here are computed from that expression at a 200 character prompt, and the range covers every ratio, because 4:3 is 768 output tokens against 1024 at 1:1. The prompt is about half a percent of the total,","tiers":[{"when":{"resolution":"1K"},"credits":11.82,"creditsRange":[8.88,11.82]},{"when":{"resolution":"1.5K"},"credits":26.49,"creditsRange":[25.93,26.49]}],"creditsRange":[8.88,26.49]},"sources":["object_info price_badge","https://openrouter.ai/microsoft/mai-image-2.6"]},
